L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E52J

   1 a 0000 E52J:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-52/P1] REGRESSION CONTROL, NO SHADOWING: proc-local d
   4 a 0006      fixed dec(9,2); d = 3; a do-while testing d > 0 with the R608
   5 a 0006      partner-aligned store d = d - 1 inside. Compiles on MINE today
   6 a 0006      (hop-1 scratch S4 rc=0, 384 B): three distinct 5-byte pool
   7 a 0006      cells plus the d cell. This row pins the EXISTING single-scope
   8 a 0006      prescan against regression -- after the scope-aware change my
   9 a 0006      object must stay byte-identical, and it ties the new bank to
  10 a 0006      settled pool laws. */
  11 c 0006   call q;
  12 c 0009   q: procedure;
  13 e 0009      dcl d fixed dec(9,2);
  14 e 000C      d = 3;
  15 e 001C      do while (d > 0);
  16 e 0032         d = d - 1;
  17 e 0051      end;
  18 c 0051      end q;
  19 a 0051 end E52J;

CODE SIZE = 0054
DATA AREA = 0014
FREE SYMS = 387E
END  COMPILATION
